Z||000005||maninblack||08-27-2000||06:50 PM||||hey guys,I have replaced the map sensor and <BR>it works "fine" at this point.Once the rpm goes while,it will adjust it down to within<BR>properly 300rpm,which is much better than before.I checked the egr tube,loos okay to me.Mt mat sensor would come until tomorrow,so I will update again.||||reg||7
Z||000006||maninblack||08-28-2000||08:07 PM||||thx to all you guys again,I have went ahead to replace the mat and O2 sensors,the idle is at perfect 900rpm now,whenever the idle drop or raise ,it would automatically corrected back to 900rpm.<BR>To round up what I did,I have replaced the following:<BR>IRA,TPS,MAP,MAT,O2 SENSORS.||||reg||10
